{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 78,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER078.YBC",
      "sha256": "109db2eea3cff69b1c2c0ef27c5386205ff730c38a3cb79f6dacf1b210532fe9",
      "text_count": 113,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 110,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "拜啟。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 132,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "給我親愛的老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 158,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "我最早前往的地方，是靜寂之都……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 180,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "在那裡，我碰見了一位總是保持沉默的老賢者。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 208,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            4,
            5
          ],
          "text": "那一位賢者只是在山野中漫步，治療受傷的麋鹿們，\n在樹葉間篩下的陽光中盡情地睡著午覺。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 230,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "照顧田地、摘取果實變成了我每天的工作。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 252,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            7
          ],
          "text": "進食的份量變得很少……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 274,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "但是我心中充滿了一種溫暖的感覺。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 306,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            9,
            10
          ],
          "text": "用抹布擦拭親手做的桌子、自己製作果醬、\n然後磨製彎曲的手杖……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 328,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "在那段時間裡，那位賢者的笑容總是溫柔地包容著我……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 356,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            12,
            13
          ],
          "text": "不知道從什麼時候開始，\n我感覺那是一件很了不起的事情。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 426,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            14
          ],
          "text": "老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 448,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "我能來這裡，真的是太好了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 482,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            16,
            17,
            18
          ],
          "text": "雖然這位老賢者只是沈默的不說任何話，\n就放任我自己去做事情，\n但是……我卻能感覺到我是被愛護著的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 508,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "為什麼我以前都沒有發覺呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 536,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            20,
            21
          ],
          "text": "原來老師以前也是這樣地愛護著我，\n直到現在，我終於理解了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 568,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            22,
            23
          ],
          "text": "原來大家也是這樣地愛護著我，\n我現在也可以理解了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 590,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            24
          ],
          "text": "我感覺我已經快要找到我所要追求的目標了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 616,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            25
          ],
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 638,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "那就這樣去做吧，一定。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 660,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "我想這樣去做。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 698,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            28,
            29,
            30
          ],
          "text": "能夠決定要這樣去做，能夠發現自己想要這樣\n去做，那時候，心中的歡喜，\n真的是筆墨無法形容。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 726,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            31,
            32
          ],
          "text": "心臟撲通撲通地在跳，感覺非常地興奮，\n晚上甚至會因為這樣而睡不著。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 764,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            33,
            34,
            35
          ],
          "text": "閉上眼睛，躺在溫暖的毛毯裡，\n心裡想著：\n「這樣的事情我可以做得到，一定做得到。」"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 786,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "這種感覺真是幸福。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 808,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            37
          ],
          "text": "總有一天，我還要再回到這裡看看。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 834,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "我想要把心中這份熱烈的思念傳達給他。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 856,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "而他一定也會用那深刻的笑容來迎接我吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 878,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            40
          ],
          "text": "就算什麼都不說也好，也一定會的……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 978,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            41,
            42
          ],
          "text": "終於，不知不覺間，\n星星不再閃耀，風聲不再呼嘯，昆蟲們也不再鳴叫。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1000,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            43
          ],
          "text": "然後，在那深沉的黑闇中，有什麼東西開始活動了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1028,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            44,
            45
          ],
          "text": "用那顫抖的聲音呢喃著，\n今天以前的自己，就在那個地方。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1054,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "自己所追求的道路。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1076,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "自己所尋找的道路。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1098,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "就算那並不是任何人所希望的結果也好。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1136,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            49,
            50,
            51
          ],
          "text": "當我不再對過去的自己有所留戀，\n想要向外走出去的那一瞬間，\n我意外地有所覺悟了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1162,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            52
          ],
          "text": "要自己去尋找自己的道路，是多麼地孤獨，多麼地艱辛呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1190,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            53,
            54
          ],
          "text": "若是只是照著別人所指示的去完成事情，\n那又是多麼地簡單呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1212,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            55
          ],
          "text": "那是一條多麼輕鬆的道路。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1246,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            56,
            57,
            58
          ],
          "text": "因為我不知道自己即將挑戰的目標有多麼困難\n，明明自己就沒有做什麼努力，只是光動著一張嘴，\n所以會碰到阻礙也是有可能的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1272,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            59
          ],
          "text": "原來，要靠自己去追尋自己的使命，"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1294,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            60
          ],
          "text": "是令人感到這麼徬徨無助的事情呀？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1316,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            61
          ],
          "text": "啊啊，然後比誰都還能夠……能夠瞭解這種感覺的老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1338,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            62
          ],
          "text": "您一直都是處於這樣的心情下嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1372,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            63,
            64,
            65
          ],
          "text": "就像那一位賢者也是，度過了數百個星光黯淡的黑夜，\n凝視著那漸漸消失的火堆和慢慢冷卻的石頭時，\n是不是也曾經因為什麼重要的事情，而突然心頭一震呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1404,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            66,
            67
          ],
          "text": "過去，我連這種「沒有別人可以依靠」的孤獨感受都不能瞭解的時候，\n又曾經帶給老師您多少的困擾呢……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1490,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            68
          ],
          "text": "我……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1522,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            69,
            70
          ],
          "text": "我上次對羅沙麗亞學姊說的話，\n一定很過分吧……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1544,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            71
          ],
          "text": "而且，對帕彌菈學姊也是……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1566,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            72
          ],
          "text": "只是一味的想被引導著就好了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1592,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            73
          ],
          "text": "只是想照著別人所說的話去做就好了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1626,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            74,
            75,
            76
          ],
          "text": "雖然以某個人為目標，\n或是被某些人親切地引導著，\n但是對他們的想法，我卻一點也無法理解。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1658,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            77,
            78
          ],
          "text": "他們也是多麼地想開口問問別人，\n自己應該怎麼做不是嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1680,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            79
          ],
          "text": "如果我不想辦法進步的話是不行的……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1702,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            80
          ],
          "text": "……真是個不中用的學生呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1724,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            81
          ],
          "text": "老師，您應該是這麼認為的吧……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1750,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            82
          ],
          "text": "羅沙麗亞學姊並沒有拋棄純潔之盾。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1772,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            83
          ],
          "text": "奧吉爾學長當然也不只是單純地離開而已。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1798,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            84
          ],
          "text": "很確定的，他們都沒有放棄與背叛的理由。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1820,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            85
          ],
          "text": "……他們是在前進呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1842,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            86
          ],
          "text": "為了要向某種東西挑戰。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1874,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            87,
            88
          ],
          "text": "那麼，難道我就要像這樣地在這裡終老一生嗎\n？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1896,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            89
          ],
          "text": "不，不會的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1918,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            90
          ],
          "text": "……我不想輸給他們。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1956,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            91,
            92,
            93
          ],
          "text": "就算我的能力比不上他們，也不瞭解他們所要\n追求的是什麼，至少，我的這一份信念不可以\n輸給他們。如果我要以他們為目標的話。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 1978,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            94
          ],
          "text": "若是連這一份思念都不如他們強烈的話，"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2000,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            95
          ],
          "text": "又怎麼有可能趕上他們呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2026,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            96
          ],
          "text": "在孕育了他們的純潔之盾裡前進。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2048,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            97
          ],
          "text": "不依靠別人的力量，用自己的雙腳前進。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2074,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            98
          ],
          "text": "晚安，老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2102,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            99,
            100
          ],
          "text": "雖然別離只會充滿了淚水，\n但是我一定會帶著笑容回到伊諾森提雅的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2124,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            101
          ],
          "text": "……嗯嗯，但是，說不定還是會哭出來了呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2146,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            102
          ],
          "text": "這不是因為悲傷而哭泣。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2178,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            103,
            104
          ],
          "text": "而是因為太開心了而落淚，\n這樣的事情也是有的，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2200,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            105
          ],
          "text": "就快要到達伊諾森提雅了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2222,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            106
          ],
          "text": "我會好好加油的，一定會。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2244,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            107
          ],
          "text": "然後讓我的心願實現，一定會的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2276,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            108,
            109
          ],
          "text": "看著吉爾梅亞閣下的微笑，\n就會讓我有這種感覺呢～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2304,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            110,
            111
          ],
          "text": "老師那深沉的眼神中，\n是不是也有著這樣的感覺呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 78,
          "source_offset": 2326,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            112
          ],
          "text": "我，也想成為那樣的一個人。"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 232,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER232.YBC",
      "sha256": "81531cd27e26f7c601ceff98b537dff9897c3e10ceec503e8dada2b7339ef2a3",
      "text_count": 40,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 106,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "你是認真的嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 148,
          "speaker_id": 107,
          "speaker": "鮑貝斯",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 186,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            2,
            3,
            4
          ],
          "text": "雖然釋放了聖瑟維艾斯的人是一件好事啦……\n但是現在讓他們回沉思的聖堂是很危險的，\n難道你看不出來嗎！！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 212,
          "speaker_id": 107,
          "speaker": "鮑貝斯",
          "text_indices": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "……他們已經對我們請求很多次了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 238,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "～～～～！！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 270,
          "speaker_id": 107,
          "speaker": "鮑貝斯",
          "text_indices": [
            7,
            8
          ],
          "text": "那些孩子明明知道這樣很危險……\n但是仍然希望離開這裡。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 296,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "那奈比洛斯閣下呢！？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 334,
          "speaker_id": 107,
          "speaker": "鮑貝斯",
          "text_indices": [
            10,
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "他現在非常地衰弱。\n恐怕連要離開眺望萬物的尖塔的體力都沒有了\n。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 360,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 386,
          "speaker_id": 107,
          "speaker": "鮑貝斯",
          "text_indices": [
            14
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 418,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            15,
            16
          ],
          "text": "在眺望萬物的尖塔裡所遵行的邏輯，\n還真是相當古怪呀……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 462,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            17,
            18
          ],
          "text": "……羅弗利。\n現在沒有時間責怪他們了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 488,
          "speaker_id": 116,
          "speaker": "羅弗利",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "可惡……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 514,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "……所以情況怎樣了？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 586,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            21,
            22,
            23,
            24
          ],
          "text": "沉思聖堂的底層已經被「匍伏蔓延而來之物」\n所佔領，\n但是在靠近聖堂頂層的部分，\n還保持著原有的力量。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 618,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            25,
            26
          ],
          "text": "也就是說……\n只要幫他們爭取逃脫的時間就可以了？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 644,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "……是的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 676,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            28,
            29
          ],
          "text": "聖堂頂端的守護塔……\n我曾經去過一次呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 702,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "是啊，我們一起去的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 734,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            31,
            32
          ],
          "text": "……是在那裡呀。\n守護塔應該還在吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 760,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            33
          ],
          "text": "這是當然的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 786,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "……去把孩子們救出來吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 812,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            35
          ],
          "text": "是的……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 834,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 856,
          "speaker_id": 107,
          "speaker": "鮑貝斯",
          "text_indices": [
            37
          ],
          "text": "一切就拜託各位幫忙了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 878,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            38
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 232,
          "source_offset": 900,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "沒什麼時間了，趕快出發吧。"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "offset": 932,
          "opcode": 151,
          "operands": [
            12,
